00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:33.990
Because accessibility intimately touches
each of these three things.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.860
So we, when we use the term accessibility
in the context of technology.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:43.279
We are typically talking about people with
disabilities interacting with computers.

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:47.940
And in order for people with disabilities
to interact with computers

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:53.290
successfully, in some cases, they need to
use a assistive technology.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.550
Now one example of that, that we're gonna
focus on today is screen readers.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.780
And that's a piece of assistive technology
that

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:00.640
