00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.580
The place where design comes in is that in

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:08.950
order for your experience, your web
experience that you're building.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.616
The product that you're building, to be
usable,

00:09:11.616 --> 00:09:14.279
